meta {
  name: EC28 Cron overlap or restart
  seq: 29
}

script:pre-request {
  if (!bru.getVar("baseUrl")) bru.setVar("baseUrl", "http://localhost:3000/api/v1");
}

docs {
  Scenario: a slow cron run, or a server restart.
Expected: a new minute is skipped if the previous run is still going (no double count); after restart the clock continues sanely.
Status: VERIFIED by unit test (overlap guard) + code review.

  Run 00 Base Setup first (same session) so the shared vars are available.
}
